{
  "title": "How Reel Studio works",
  "lang": "en",
  "voice_source": "recorded",
  "presenter": {
    "photo": "examples/assets/presenter/presenter.png",
    "crop": [
      450,
      200,
      420
    ],
    "title": "Your title · Your role",
    "subtitle": "How Reel Studio works"
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "This video was edited by an app I built with AI. Let me show you how it works.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "title",
          "params": {
            "kicker": "REEL STUDIO",
            "text": "An AI video editor I built"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "I write a script, and the app turns it into a finished reel with one command.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "timeline",
          "params": {
            "title": "One command",
            "items": [
              {
                "time": "Step 1",
                "text": "Script"
              },
              {
                "time": "Step 2",
                "text": "Voice"
              },
              {
                "time": "Step 3",
                "text": "Graphics + captions"
              },
              {
                "time": "Step 4",
                "text": "Quality check"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "First, I record my voice, line by line, with the laptop microphone.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "list",
          "params": {
            "title": "Record studio",
            "items": [
              "Pick your microphone",
              "Read line by line",
              "Live level meter"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A teleprompter shows me what to read, and how fast to read it.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "title",
          "params": {
            "kicker": "TELEPROMPTER",
            "text": "What to read. How fast."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Then the app cleans my audio. It removes noise, cuts the silence, and evens out the volume.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "list",
          "params": {
            "title": "Audio cleanup",
            "items": [
              "Remove room noise",
              "Cut the silence",
              "Even out the volume"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Next, AI listens to every take and compares it to the script.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "title",
          "params": {
            "kicker": "AI LISTENS",
            "text": "Every take vs the script"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "If I miss one word, it tells me which word, and I record it again.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "compare",
          "params": {
            "before": "Heard: \"compares it to the\"",
            "after": "Missing: \"script\" → record again"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Then it builds the graphics you are watching right now, one for every line.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "title",
          "params": {
            "kicker": "MOTION GRAPHICS",
            "text": "One for every line"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It adds English captions, timed to every word I say.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "title",
          "params": {
            "kicker": "CAPTIONS",
            "text": "Timed to every word"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And it exports in 4K, at 60 frames per second.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "stat",
          "params": {
            "value": "4",
            "suffix": "K",
            "label": "at 60 frames per second"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Before I post, it checks the final video, from the sound to the picture.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "list",
          "params": {
            "title": "Final check",
            "items": [
              "Picture size and quality",
              "Loudness",
              "Every word heard clearly"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "If one check fails, I fix it first.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "title",
          "params": {
            "kicker": "QUALITY GATE",
            "text": "Fail one check? Fix it first."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "What should I build next? Tell me in the comments.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "title",
          "params": {
            "kicker": "YOUR TURN",
            "text": "What should I build next?"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}